 "notes": [
  "A new look and a new logo: clean and calm, in light and dark (Settings > Appearance, or it follows your phone or PC).",
  "Typing on the phone stays where you put it: the page no longer jumps while you write, and ticking items keeps the keyboard up.",
  "If your PC (or Jarvis) changes a note while you're writing in it, both of your changes are kept.",
  "Settings stops taking over: it only shows when you open it.",
  "Vault updates itself now, on your phone and your PC, when you're not using it."
